        "body": "## Summary\n- add read-only MessageStore stats aggregation for messages by chat, handle, service, and day\n- add optional media attachment totals grouped by UTI/MIME and chat\n- expose stats via `imsg stats`, `server.getMessageStats`, `getMediaStatistics`, and `getMediaStatisticsByChat`\n- document the CLI/RPC surface and update the imsg skill/changelog\n\n## Verification\n- `make build` ✅\n- release binary smoke test against a temporary SQLite fixture ✅\n- before/after proof on lobster ✅\n- CI macOS lint failure addressed by moving stats RPC handlers out of `RPCServer+Handlers.swift` (`608` → `580` lines) ✅\n- `make test` ⚠️ blocked before project tests run locally: SwiftPM cannot import the repo-wide `Testing` module (`no such module 'Testing'`) with Apple Swift 6.3.1 on this host\n- `make lint` ⚠️ on lobster: `swift format lint` completed, then local `swiftlint` crashed loading `sourcekitdInProc.framework`; CI uses SwiftLint successfully and is the source of truth for lint\n\n## Proof\n\n```text\nPR #161 message-stats proof summary\nmain_head=c541bea2828f773e85588d0598ed3565140736f2\nbranch_head=503e9f03791fdb3dc5bd9035aa92003353ad23ae\nbefore_stats_exit=1\nbefore_completion_search_exit=1\nafter_quick_check=ok\nafter_total_messages=789\nafter_chat_total_messages=574\nafter_media_total_attachments=22\nafter_media_total_bytes=35095987\nrpc_methods_ok=3\nmake_build_main=passed\nmake_build_branch=passed\nmake_lint_local=blocked_sourcekitdInProc_on_lobster\nci_macos_lint_fix=split_RPCServer+Handlers_608_to_580_lines\nmake_test=blocked_no_such_module_Testing\n```\n\nRaw proof logs are stored locally under `/Users/lobster/imsg-pr-proofs/2026-07-08/161-message-stats/`. They are not pasted here because they include local chat identifiers/handles from lobster's Messages database.\n",
